# Build output. The site is rebuilt from source on every deploy, so none of it
# is committed — including the WebAssembly module and Go's runtime shim, which
# have to be produced by the same Go toolchain as each other and would rot the
# moment one was committed and the other regenerated.
dist/
dist-dev/
ui/public/ferry.wasm
ui/public/wasm_exec.js

node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
*.log

# The Solana program's build output, including the keypair whose public half IS
# the deployed address. Committing that keypair would publish the authority that
# can upgrade the program.
program/target/

# Go: test binaries and coverage output, neither of which belongs in the tree.
*.test
*.out
*.exe

# Vite's dependency cache.
.vite/
ui/.vite/

# Deploy state and anything carrying credentials.
.vercel
.env*

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.local
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/

.claude/